    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "Group Exhibition: Endless Summer",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Now in its seventeenth year, the Sedici group was founded by professor Danny Rolph in 2010. It brings together a network of post-graduate artists to continue their professional development through discussion and exhibitions. 'Endless Summer' will capture a range of artistic mediums, hosted within a reimagined school gymnasium that evokes feelings of the past, while offering a modern space for artists from all backgrounds to make and present work."
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Preview Evening, 6-8pm",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Join artists for the opening night of the exhibition and enjoy an evening of relaxed socialising within the beautiful gallery setting."
            ]
        }
